#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your existing container images still contain the vulnerable JDK.\n"
"Fixed base images do not change images you already built, nor containers already running.\n"
"You have to *rebuild* your container images on top of the fixed base image, then *redeploy* them."
