msgid "Why patch the builder images?"
msgstr "为什么要修补构建镜像？"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The `native-image` tool is a Java application.\n"
"It runs on the JDK shipped in the builder image.\n"
"That JDK is affected.\n"
"The build only processes your own code and dependencies, so the risk is low.\n"
"Still, we do not want to ship images with an unprotected vulnerable JDK.\n"
"So we applied the workaround to the builder images."
msgstr "`native-image` 工具是一个 Java 应用程序。它在构建器镜像中随附的 JDK 上运行。该 JDK 受到了影响。由于构建过程仅处理您自己的代码和依赖项，因此风险较低。尽管如此，我们仍不希望发布包含未受保护且存在漏洞的 JDK 的镜像。因此，我们已对构建器镜像应用了该临时解决方案。"

