msgid "What changed"
msgstr "发生了什么变化"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "The images have been patched with the workaround (https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus-images/pull/344[quarkus-images#344]), followed by a second patch (https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus-images/pull/345[quarkus-images#345]) to fix the `native-image` tool invocation:"
msgstr "已使用临时解决方案（ link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus-images/pull/344[quarkus-images#344] ）对图像进行了修补，随后又应用了第二个补丁（ link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus-images/pull/345[quarkus-images#345] ）来修复 `native-image` 工具的调用："

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "On amd64 images bundling an affected JDK (21 before 21.0.13.1, 25 before 25.0.5.1), the image sets `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS=-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics`."
msgstr "在捆绑了受影响 JDK（21 版本早于 21.0.13.1，25 版本早于 25.0.5.1）的 amd64 镜像中，该镜像将 `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS` 设置为 `=-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics` 。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "arm64 images are not affected and are unchanged."
msgstr "arm64 镜像不受影响，保持不变。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Once the images bundle a fixed JDK, the workaround is dropped automatically."
msgstr "一旦镜像打包了固定的 JDK，该临时解决方案就会自动失效。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Your build logs now show `Picked up JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS: -XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics`. This is expected."
msgstr "您的构建日志现在显示 `已采用 JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS：-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics` 。这是预期的行为。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "If you override `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS` when running the builder image, you drop the workaround. Keep `-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics` in your value."
msgstr "如果在运行构建镜像时覆盖了 `JAVA_TOOL_OPTIONS` ，则该变通方案将失效。请在该参数的值中保留 `-XX:-UseBASE64Intrinsics` 。"

